"<a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary mb-0 o_cc o_cc4 "
"o_translate_inline\">Configure</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary mb-0 o_cc o_cc4 o_translate_inline\">ກຳ"
"ນົດຄ່າ</a>"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.configurator_s_three_columns
msgid "<span class=\"d-inline-block mb-4\"><b>From $14,000</b></span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"d-inline-block mb-4\"><b>ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ $14,000</b></span>"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.configurator_s_three_columns
msgid "<span class=\"d-inline-block mb-4\"><b>From $19,000</b></span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"d-inline-block mb-4\"><b>ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ $19,000</b></span>"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.configurator_s_three_columns
msgid "<span class=\"d-inline-block mb-4\"><b>From $25,000</b></span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"d-inline-block mb-4\"><b>ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ $25,000</b></span>"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_picture
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-3\">Our uniquely designed LED headlights are not "
"only gorgeous but powerfully light your way.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-o-color-3\">ໄຟໜ້າ LED ທີ່ອອກແບບມາຢ່າງໂດດເດັ່ນ ບໍ່ພຽງແຕ່ສວຍງາມເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຍັງສ່ອງແສງໃຫ້ເສັ້ນທາງຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງມີພະລັງ.</span>"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"A bold statement in every detail, the Koran X captures the spirit of modern "
"adventure. Built for those who refuse to compromise on performance and style."
msgstr ""
"ໂດດເດັ່ນໃນທຸກລາຍລະອຽດ, Koran X ຖ່າຍທອດຈິດວິນຍານແຫ່ງການຜະຈົນໄພທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ. ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຍ"
"ອມປະນີປະນອມຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫງ່າງາມ."

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_title
msgid "All our models"
msgstr "ທຸກລຸ້ນຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_picture
msgid ""
"Bring the KORAN to life on your smartphone or tablet so you can visualise it "
"for yourself"
msgstr ""
"ສຳຜັດກັບ KORAN ຕົວຈິງເທິງສະມາດໂຟນ ຫຼື ແທັບເລັດຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນດ້ວຍຕົວທ່ານເ"
"ອງ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_numbers_charts
msgid ""
"Clients saved $2.4 billion by choosing our eco-efficient and cost-effective "
"vehicles."
msgstr ""
"ລູກຄ້າປະຢັດເງິນໄດ້ເຖິງ 2.4 ຕື້ໂດລາ ໂດຍການເລືອກໃຊ້ພາຫະນະທີ່ເປັນມິດຕໍ່ສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ປະຢັດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂ"
"ອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_vehicle
msgid ""
"Cover hero opens onto a title block, a three-column lineup, a featured "
"picture, key visuals, charted KPIs, and a media list, kept clean and photo-"
"driven throughout. Image-and-stats forward with technical credibility - "
"suited for car dealerships, motorbike retailers, tire shops, mechanics, and "
"vehicle repair services"
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າປົກຫຼັກເປີດໄປສູ່ຫົວຂໍ້, ຕາຕະລາງສາມຖັນ, ຮູບພາບເດັ່ນ, ຮູບພາບຫຼັກ, ແຜນວາດ KPI, ແລະ ລາຍການສື່, ໂດ"
"ຍເນັ້ນຄວາມສະອາດຕາ ແລະ ຮູບພາບຕະຫຼອດທັງໜ້າ. ເນັ້ນຮູບພາບ ແລະ ສະຖິຕິພ້ອມຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືທາງດ້ານເຕັກນິ"
"ກ - ເໝາະສຳລັບຕົວແທນຈຳໜ່າຍລົດໃຫຍ່, ຮ້ານຂາຍລົດຈັກ, ຮ້ານຢາງລົດ, ຊ່າງແປງ, ແລະ ອູ່ສ້ອມແປງພາຫະນະ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"Designed for the thrill-seeker, the Koran GT brings race-inspired "
"performance to the streets. Precision-tuned for speed, it promises an "
"driving experience."
msgstr ""
"ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ມັກຄວາມຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ, Koran GT ນຳເອົາປະສິດທິພາບລະດັບສະໜາມແຂ່ງມາສູ່ຖະໜົນ. ປັບແຕ່ງມາ"
"ຢ່າງລະອຽດເພື່ອຄວາມໄວ, ພ້ອມມອບປະສົບການຂັບຂີ່ທີ່ໜ້າຕື່ນຕາຕື່ນໃຈ."

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_key_images
msgid "Discover Excellence in Luxury Vehicle Care"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນພົບຄວາມເປັນເລີດໃນການດູແລພາຫະນະລະດັບຫຼູຫຼາ"

