msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຮູບແບບ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_key_images
msgid "Trust us to keep your luxury vehicle in pristine condition"
msgstr "ໄວ້ວາງໃຈພວກເຮົາໃນການດູແລຮັກສາລົດຫຼູຫຼາຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະພາບໃໝ່ສະເໝີ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"Unleashing power with elegance, the Koran Mini blends advanced engineering "
"with classic design, delivering a thrilling ride that’s both swift and "
"smooth."
msgstr ""
"ປົດປ່ອຍພະລັງພ້ອມຄວາມສະຫງ່າງາມ, Koran Mini ຜະສົມຜະສານວິສະວະກຳຂັ້ນສູງເຂົ້າກັບການອອກແບບຄລາດສິ"
"ກ, ມອບການຂັບຂີ່ທີ່ຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ ທັງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ນຸ້ມນວນ."

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_theme_vehicle
msgid "Vehicle Theme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຍານພາຫະນະ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_theme_vehicle
msgid ""
"Vehicle, Cars, Motorbikes, Bikes, Tires, Transports, Repair, Mechanics, "
"Garages, Sports, Services"
msgstr ""
"ພາຫະນະ, ລົດໃຫຍ່, ລົດຈັກ, ລົດຖີບ, ຢາງລົດ, ການຂົນສົ່ງ, ສ້ອມແປງ, ຊ່າງແປງ, ອູ່ສ້ອມແປງ, ກິລາ, ການບໍ"
"ລິການ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_picture
msgid "View the all-new KORAN in 3D wherever you are"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ KORAN ໃໝ່ຫຼ້າສຸດໃນຮູບແບບ 3D ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະຢູ່ໃສກໍຕາມ"

#. module: theme_vehicle
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_vehicle.s_numbers_charts
msgid "We proudly serve over 300,000 satisfied customers."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາມີຄວາມພາກພູມໃຈທີ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການລູກຄ້າທີ່ພໍໃຈຫຼາຍກວ່າ 300,000 ຄົນ."
